        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p>If your next action is to Cast a Spell with a duration of no longer than 10 minutes that targets a single creature, you can amplify and reroute the defensive barrier being generated by your armor to empower your target. You Overclock Armor, immediately lose all your temporary Hit Points, and grant the same amount of temporary Hit Points you lost to the target of the spell. These temporary Hit Points last until the spell ends.</p>"
